# Home is tonight's games under a menu row: Tonight, By sport, Replays, Live TV,
# Search, Settings. Up from the first game (or Tab) reaches the menu, Left and Right
# move along it, and the status line says what the highlighted tab holds. Esc from a
# destination returns to Home with its tab still highlighted. Works before the games
# finish loading: with no games yet, Tab stays on the menu.
start ^ Tonight
key s => ^ By sport: choose a sport
key Esc => ^ Tonight
key Tab => Tonight's games, live ones first
key Right => One sport's games
key Enter => ^ By sport: choose a sport
key Esc => One sport's games
key Right => Finished games
key Enter => ^ Replays: choose a sport
key Esc => Finished games
key Right => Sports and news channels
key Enter => > ESPN
key Esc => Sports and news channels
key Right => Find a team, player
key Enter => ^ Find:
key Esc => Find a team, player
key Right => Video player, backup stream
key Enter => > Video player
key Esc => Video player, backup stream
key Left => Find a team, player
key Enter => ^ Find:
